  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory brand packaging, Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the truck. Made from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl that will not stretch, fade or crack.\nFitment\nCompatible with Toyota Tacoma 2005-2015 5ft fleetside bed\nNOTE:\nPlease measure your truck bed size or contact your dealer to confirm the correct model before ordering.\nCab size does not matter as long as you have the correct model and bed size.\nFeatures\n【Precisely Fit】100% factory brand packaging; Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatible with Toyota Tacoma 5' bed 2005 2006 2007 2008 2009 2010 2011 2012 2013 2014 2015.\n【Easy Installation】No tools or drilling required; Upgraded clamps with adjustable holes allow for an easy installation within 20 minutes; user friendly design for easy assembly and dis-assembly.\n【Safety First】Reinforced corner design keeps the cover tight to the bed; sturdy clamps and buckles with straps protect the cover from sliding or blowing off while driving.\n【Premium Quality】Made with double layer PVC on the top, structured with solid alloy in the frame, this back cover is build to last for your truck.\n【All season Protection】 Features tear resistant, water resistance, high temperature resistance, no matter where you are or what the weather is like, we’ve got you covered.",
